			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Fee paid previously with preliminary materials.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
