			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>June 26, 2026</b></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:25.2%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i>Chief Executive Officer and Chairman</i></p>
