			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(1)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Dayton Judd served as the Company&#8217;s PEO during the fiscal years presented. The following amounts were added and deducted from the Summary Compensation Table (&#8220;<i>SCT</i>&#8221;) amount to determine the compensation actually paid to the PEO in accordance with SEC regulations</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

