			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For the year ended December 31, 2025, Ryan Hansen and Jakob York were our other NEOs. The following amounts were added and deducted from the Average Summary Compensation Total amount to determine the average compensation actually paid to our other NEOs in accordance with SEC regulations:</p>
			</td>
